iv><b>Gato coco</b><p>Chewy coconut sweets, usually pink and white.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="fd-block"><p class="section-label">TO DRINK</p><h2>Something to wash it down</h2><div class="drink-grid six"><div class="drink"><img src="assets/images/drinks/phoenix_beer.jpeg" alt="Phoenix beer" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><div><b>Phoenix beer</b><p>The local lager, brewed since 1963.</p></div></div><div class="drink"><img src="assets/images/drinks/mauritian_rum.jpeg" alt="Mauritian rum" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><div><b>Mauritian rum</b><p>Try a Ti’ Punch, or rhum arrangé steeped with fruit and spices.</p></div></div><div class="drink"><img src="assets/images/drinks/vanilla_tea.jpeg" alt="Vanilla tea" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><div><b>Vanilla tea</b><p>Mauritian tea, often flavoured with vanilla. Taste it at Bois Chéri.</p></div></div><div class="drink"><img src="assets/images/drinks/fresh_coconut.jpeg" alt="Fresh coconut" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><div><b>Fresh coconut</b><p>Sold green and chilled from roadside stands.</p></div></div><div class="drink"><span class="fav-tag rec"><b>★</b> Bride recommended</span><svg class="drink-art" viewBox="0 0 300 200" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="300" height="200" fill="#1670b8"/><g fill="#fffdf7" opacity=".18"><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="5"/><circle cx="20" cy="60" r="5"/><circle cx="20" cy="100" r="5"/><circle cx="20" cy="140" r="5"/><circle cx="20" cy="180" r="5"/><circle cx="60" cy="20" r="5"/><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="5"/><circle cx="60" cy="100" r="5"/><circle cx="60" cy="140" r="5"/><circle cx="60" cy="180" r="5"/><circle cx="100" cy="20" r="5"/><circle cx="100" cy="60" r="5"/><circle cx="100" cy="100" r="5"/><circle cx="100" cy="140" r="5"/><circle cx="100" cy="180" r="5"/><circle cx="140" cy="20" r="5"/><circle cx="140" cy="60" r="5"/><circle cx="140" cy="100" r="5"/><circle cx="140" cy="140" r="5"/><circle cx="140" cy="180" r="5"/><circle cx=