+<div class="wr-tip"><b>Good to know</b><span>It’s outdoors and on grass, so block heels or flats are easier than stilettos, and evenings can feel cool.</span><a href="https://www.pinterest.com/search/pins/?q=chic%20evening%20wedding%20guest%20outfit" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More ideas on Pinterest →</a></div></div>
+<div class="fd-block"><p class="section-label">A QUICK GLOSSARY</p><h2>What’s what</h2><div class="wr-gl"><div><b>Lehenga</b><p>A long, flared skirt worn with a fitted blouse (choli) and a scarf (dupatta).</p></div><div><b>Saree</b><p>A single long piece of fabric draped around the body over a short blouse.</p></div><div><b>Anarkali</b><p>A long, flowing kurta dress that flares from the chest.</p></div><div><b>Sharara</b><p>Wide, flared trousers worn with a short kurta.</p></div><div><b>Dupatta</b><p>A long scarf, draped over one shoulder or both.</p></div><div><b>Kurta</b><p>A long tunic shirt, worn by men and women.</p></div><div><b>Sherwani</b><p>A long, often embroidered coat for men, buttoned to the neck.</p></div><div><b>Nehru jacket / bandhgala</b><p>A collarless waistcoat, or a high-collared jacket, worn over a kurta or shirt.</p></div></div></div><div class="fd-block"><p class="section-label">FINDING AN OUTFIT</p><h2>Where to get one</h2><div class="wr-get">
+<div><b>Borrow</b><p>Ask Indian friends and family. Most people are delighted to lend an outfit, and to help you put it on.</p></div>
+<div><b>Buy or rent online</b><p>Plenty of shops sell and rent Indian outfits online. Order early and allow time for alterations.</p></div>
+<div><b>Have one made in Mauritius</b><p>Tailors and fabric shops in Port Louis can make an outfit, if you arrive a few days early.</p></div>
+</div><p class="wr-help">Not sure what to choose? Message Sonali, she’d love to help.</p></div>
